te-locale-des-communes-2026-hors-taux/attachments/descriptif_delibcom26xlsx"}, "id": "57863742-388d-46db-b1d0-9e29cf9293f7", "internal": {"created_at_internal": "2026-07-25T00:06:49.028000+00:00", "last_modified_internal": "2026-07-25T00:06:49.028000+00:00"}, "last_modified": "2026-07-24T14:56:15+00:00", "latest": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/api/1/datasets/r/57863742-388d-46db-b1d0-9e29cf9293f7", "metrics": {"views": 122}, "mime": null, "preview_url": "https://explore.data.gouv.fr/fr/resources/57863742-388d-46db-b1d0-9e29cf9293f7", "schema": null, "title": "Descriptif_delibCOM26.xlsx", "type": "other", "url": "https://data.economie.gouv.fr/api/v2/catalog/datasets/deliberations-de-fiscalite-directe-locale-des-communes-2026-hors-taux/attachments/descriptif_delibcom26xlsx"}], "schema": null, "slug": "deliberations-de-fiscalite-directe-locale-des-communes-2026-hors-taux", "spatial": null, "tags": ["2026", "communes", "fiscalite", "impots-locaux"], "temporal_coverage": null, "title": "D\u00e9lib\u00e9rations de fiscalit\u00e9 directe locale des communes 2026 (hors taux)", "uri": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/api/1/datasets/deliberations-de-fiscalite-directe-locale-des-communes-2026-hors-taux/"}, {"access_audiences": [], "access_type": "open", "access_type_reason": null, "access_type_reason_category": null, "acronym": null, "archived": null, "authorization_request_url": null, "badges": [], "contact_points": [{"contact_form": null, "email": null, "id": "67b7c4408743ff58f7e260e3", "name": "DGFIP", "organization": {"acronym": "MEF", "badges": [{"kind": "public-service"}, {"kind": "certified"}], "class": "Organization", "id": "534fff8ea3a7292c64a77f02", "logo": "https://udata-avatars.s3.rbx.io.cloud.ovh.net/3b/06ce9c1027460a87364418789747b6.jpg", "logo_thumbnail": "https://udata-avatars.s3.rbx.io.cloud.ovh.net/3b/06ce9c1027460a87364418789747b6-100.jpg", "name": "Minist\u00e8res \u00e9conomiques et financiers", "page": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/organizations/ministeres-economiques-et-financiers", "permissions": {"delete": false, "edit": false, "harvest": false, "members": false, "private": false}, "slug": "ministeres-economiques-et-financiers", "uri": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/api/1/organizations/ministeres-economiques-et-financiers/"}, "owner": null, "role": "publisher"}], "created_at": "2026-07-01T00:00:00+00:00", "deleted": null, "description": "D\u00e9lais de paiement 2025 des collectivit\u00e9s territoriales\n\n    \n\n  \n\n\nLe pr\u00e9sent fichier est un fichier agr\u00e9g\u00e9 au niveau des budgets des collectivit\u00e9s.  \n  \nIl pr\u00e9sente la moyenne annuelle pour 2025 du d\u00e9lai global de paiement de chaque budget collectivit\u00e9, arr\u00eat\u00e9 au 31/12/2025. \n\n**Sont concern\u00e9es dans ce fichier toutes les collectivit\u00e9s, y compris celles de <3500 habitants. **  \n  \nNous recommandons de consulter en amont la structure de fichier en pi\u00e8ce jointe qui d\u00e9crit les variables pr\u00e9sentes dans le jeu de donn\u00e9es.  \n  \nPour m\u00e9moire, l'obligation de publication des d\u00e9lais de paiement des collectivit\u00e9s r\u00e9sulte de la loi du 7 octobre 2016 (article L. 321-1-1 du code des relations entre le public et l'administration) pr\u00e9cis\u00e9e par la loi n\u00b0 2019-486 du 22 mai 2019 relative \u00e0 la croissance et la transformation des entreprises (22\u00b0 de l'article 221).", "description_short": null, "extras": {"dcat": {"license": ["https://www.etalab.gouv.fr/wp-content/uploads/2017/04/ETALAB-Licence-Ouverte-v2.0.pdf"], "rights": ["https://www.etalab.gouv.fr/wp-content/uploads/2017/04/ETALAB-Licence-Ouverte-v2.0.pdf"]}}, "featured": false, "frequency": "annual", "frequency_date": null, "harvest": {"backend": "DCAT", "dct_identifier": "https://data.economie.gouv.fr/explore/dataset/delai-paiement-moyen-collectivites-2025/", "domain": "data.economie.gouv.fr", "issued_at": "2026-07-01T00:00:00+00:00", "last_update": "2026-10-03T00:02:41.991000+00:00", "modified_at": "2026-07-17T10:38:2