7292c64a77f02", "logo": "https://udata-avatars.s3.rbx.io.cloud.ovh.net/3b/06ce9c1027460a87364418789747b6.jpg", "logo_thumbnail": "https://udata-avatars.s3.rbx.io.cloud.ovh.net/3b/06ce9c1027460a87364418789747b6-100.jpg", "name": "Minist\u00e8res \u00e9conomiques et financiers", "page": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/organizations/ministeres-economiques-et-financiers", "permissions": {"delete": false, "edit": false, "harvest": false, "members": false, "private": false}, "slug": "ministeres-economiques-et-financiers", "uri": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/api/1/organizations/ministeres-economiques-et-financiers/"}, "owner": null, "role": "contact"}, {"contact_form": null, "email": null, "id": "6a4d95ac6eb89eb6c17a6797", "name": "DESF", "organization": {"acronym": "MEF", "badges": [{"kind": "public-service"}, {"kind": "certified"}], "class": "Organization", "id": "534fff8ea3a7292c64a77f02", "logo": "https://udata-avatars.s3.rbx.io.cloud.ovh.net/3b/06ce9c1027460a87364418789747b6.jpg", "logo_thumbnail": "https://udata-avatars.s3.rbx.io.cloud.ovh.net/3b/06ce9c1027460a87364418789747b6-100.jpg", "name": "Minist\u00e8res \u00e9conomiques et financiers", "page": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/organizations/ministeres-economiques-et-financiers", "permissions": {"delete": false, "edit": false, "harvest": false, "members": false, "private": false}, "slug": "ministeres-economiques-et-financiers", "uri": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/api/1/organizations/ministeres-economiques-et-financiers/"}, "owner": null, "role": "publisher"}], "created_at": "2026-08-11T08:00:00+00:00", "deleted": null, "description": "Les donn\u00e9es pr\u00e9sent\u00e9es repr\u00e9sentent l'ensemble des droits de mutation \u00e0 titre on\u00e9reux d'immeubles affect\u00e9s aux collectivit\u00e9s locales soit : la Taxe D\u00e9partementale sur la Publicit\u00e9 Fonci\u00e8re (TDPF), les Droits D\u00e9partementaux d'Enregistrement (DDE), la Taxe D\u00e9partementale Additionnelle aux Droits d'Enregistrement (TDAD), la part communale correspond \u00e0 la taxe communale additionnelle aux droits d'enregistrement revers\u00e9e aux communes, somm\u00e9e sur l'ensemble des communes du d\u00e9partement (TCAD) ainsi que la part r\u00e9gionale correspondant \u00e0 taxe r\u00e9gionale additionnelle aux droits d'enregistrement (TRAD).   \n  \nLes montants correspondent aux recouvrements enregistr\u00e9s par direction locale dans la comptabilit\u00e9 auxiliaire de la DGFiP. Les montants ventil\u00e9s par collectivit\u00e9 attributaire sont pr\u00e9sent\u00e9s dans [un autre jeu de donn\u00e9es](https://data.economie.gouv.fr/explore/assets/dmto_attrib/).\n\nLes recettes sont enregistr\u00e9es le mois de leur comptabilisation dans l'application MEDOC de comptabilit\u00e9 auxiliaire de la DGFiP, qui n'est pas forc\u00e9ment le mois o\u00f9 a lieu la transaction correspondante. En certains cas, des pics d\u2019enregistrement peuvent s'observer, correspondant \u00e0 des op\u00e9rations exceptionnelles ou \u00e0 l'enregistrement un mois donn\u00e9 de transactions des mois pr\u00e9c\u00e9dents, en lien avec la r\u00e9organisation du r\u00e9seau de la DGFiP  \n\n\n\u00c0 compter de 2018, la collectivit\u00e9 de Corse poss\u00e8de un statut particulier au sens de l'article 72 de la Constitution, en lieu et place de la collectivit\u00e9 territoriale de Corse et des d\u00e9partements de Corse-du-Sud et de Haute-Corse (cf. art. L4421-1 du CGCT). La part d\u00e9partementale des deux anciens d\u00e9partements est ainsi agr\u00e9g\u00e9e sur l'ancien d\u00e9partement de Corse du Sud, si\u00e8ge de la pairie de la collectivit\u00e9.   \n  \nEn application de la loi du 2 ao\u00fbt 2019 (n\u00b02019-816), \u00e0 compter du 1er janvier 2021, les d\u00e9partements du Bas-Rhin et du Haut-Rhin sont regroup\u00e9s sous le nom de \u00ab Collectivit\u00e9 europ\u00e9enne d'Alsace \u00bb. La part d\u00e9partementale des deux anciens d\u00e9partements est ainsi agr\u00e9g\u00e9e sur l'ancien d\u00e9partement du Haut-Rhin, si\u00e8ge de la paierie de la Collectivit\u00e9 europ\u00e9enne d'Alsace.   \n  \nLa part d\u00e9partementale du d\u00e9partement du Rh\u00f4ne et de la M\u00e9tropole de Lyon sont agr\u00e9g\u00e9es sur le d\u00e9partement du Rh\u00f4ne.", "description_short": null, "extras": {}, "featured": false, "frequency": "monthly", "frequency_date": null, "harvest": {"backend": "DCAT", "dct_identifier": "https://data.economie.gouv.fr/explore/dataset/dmto_recouv/", "domain": "data.economie.gouv.fr", "issued_at": "2026-08-11T08:00:00+00:00", "last_update": "2026-10-03T00:02:30.491000+00:00", "modified_at": "2026-08-11T08:00:00+00:00", "remote_id": "https://data.economie.gouv.fr/explore/dataset/dmto_recouv/", "remote_url": "https://data.economie.gouv.fr/explore/dataset/dmto_recouv/", "source_id": "5cd454758b4c4139d85b64f2", "uri": "https://data.economie.gouv.fr/explore/dataset/dmto_recouv/"}, "id": "6a4d95addda81151ddc275f3", "internal": {"created_at_internal": "2026-07-08T00:11:25.569000+00:00", "last_modified_internal": "2026-07-08T00:11:25.569000+00:00"}, "last_modified": "2026-08-11T08:00:00+00:00", "last_update": "2026-08-11T08:00:00+00:00", "license": "notspecified", "metrics": {"dataservices": 2, "discussions": 0, "discussions_open": 0, "followers": 0, "followers_by_months": 0, "resources_downloads": 27, "reuses": 0, "reuses_by_months": 0, "views": 3395}, "organization": {"acronym": "MEF", "badges": [{"kind": "public-service"}, {"kind": "certified"}], "class": "Organization", "id": "534fff8ea3a7292c64a77f02", "logo": "https://udata-avatars.s3.rbx.io.cloud.ovh.net/3b/06ce9c1027460a87364418789747b6.jpg", "logo_thumbnail": "https://udata-avatars.s3.rbx.io.cloud.ovh.net/3b/06ce9c1027460a87364418789747b6-100.jpg", "name": "Minist\u00e8res \u00e9conomiques et financiers", "page": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/organizations/ministeres-economiques-et-financiers", "permissions": {"delete": false, "edit": false, "harvest": false, "members": false, "private": false}, "slug": "ministeres-economiques-et-financiers", "uri": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/api/1/organizations/ministeres-economiques-et-financiers/"}, "owner": null, "page": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/datasets/droits-de-mutations-a-titre-onereux-dimmeubles-par-direction-de-recouvrement", "permissions": {"delete": false, "edit": false, "edit_resources": false}, "private": false, "quality": {"all_resources_available": true, "dataset_description_quality": true, "has_open_format": true, "has_resources": true, "license": true, "resources_documentation": true, "score": 0.7777777777777778, "spatial": false, "temporal_coverage": true, "update_frequency": true, "update_fulfilled_in_time": false}, "resources": [{"checksum": null, "created_at": "2026-08-11T08:00:00+00:00", "description": "Droits de mutations \u00e0 titre on\u00e9reux d'immeubles par direction de recouvrement (csv)", "extras": {"analysis:check_id": 52322061, "analysis:checksum": "cdc3ba8bc7dd8b491b110100878d89bac5bc0a12", "analysis:content-length": 3600562, "analysis:last-modified-at": "2026-08-11T08:00:00+00:00", "analysis:last-modified-detection": "harvest-resource-metadata", "analysis:mime-type": "text/plain", "analysis:parsing:finished_at": "2026-08-25T22:58:13.018303+00:00", "analysis:parsing:parquet_size": 323318, "analysis:parsing:parquet_url": "https://hydra.s3.rbx.io.cloud.ovh.net/parquet/5f89fb7a-1513-4c0c-bcba-234ccfaf5ab6.parquet", "analysis:parsing:parsing_table": "eb79d2bfee92fe9ad8086c05552ccd4f", "analysis:parsing:started_at": "2026-08-25T22:58:12.434292+00:00", "check:available": true, "check:cors:allow-headers": "Authorization, X-Requested-With, Origin, ODS-API-Analytics-App, ODS-API-Analytics-Embed-Type, ODS-API-Analytics-Embed-Referrer, ODS-Widgets-Version, Accept", "check:cors:allow-methods": "POST, GET, OPTIONS", "check:cors:allow-origin": "*", "check:cors:expose-headers": "ODS-Explore-API-Deprecation, Link, X-RateLimit-Remaining, X-RateLimit-Limit, X-RateLimit-Reset, X-RateLimit-dataset-Remaining, X-RateLimit-dataset-Limit, X-RateLimit-dataset-Reset", "check:cors:max-age": "1000", "check:cors:status": 200, "check:date": "2026-07-09T04:14:49.677948+00:00", "check:headers:content-type": "text/csv", "check:id": 49706356, "check:status": 200, "check:timeout": false}, "filesize": null, "filetype": "remote", "format": "csv", "harvest": {"issued_at": "2026-08-11T08:00:00+00:00", "last_update": "2026-10-03T00:02:30.489000+00:00", "modified_at": "2026-08-11T08:00:00+00:00", "uri": "https://data.economie.gouv.fr/api/explore/v2.1/catalog/datasets/dmto_recouv/exports/csv?use_labels=true"}, "id": "5f89fb7a-1513-4c0c-bcba-234ccfaf5ab6", "internal": {"created_at_internal": "2026-07-08T00:11:25.576000+00:00", "last_modified_internal": "2026-07-08T00:11:25.576000+00:00"}, "last_modified": "2026-08-11T08:00:00+00:00", "latest": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/api/1/datasets/r/5f89fb7a-1513-4c0c-bcba-234ccfaf5ab6", "metrics": {"views": 18}, "mime": "text/csv", "preview_url": "https://explore.data.gouv.fr/fr/resources/5f89fb7a-1513-4c0c-bcba-234ccfaf5ab6", "schema": null, "title": "dmto_recouv.csv", "type": "main", "url": "https://data.economie.gouv.fr/api/explore/v2.1/catalog/datasets/dmto_recouv/exports/csv?use_labels=true"}, {"checksum": null, "created_at": "2026-08-11T08:00:00+00:00", "description": "Droits de mutations \u00e0 titre on\u00e9reux d'immeubles par direction de recouvrement (json)", "extras": {"analysis:check_id": 52322677, "analysis:checksum": "cf5cf9b68cbd501a10f5f17576002e2c12fe49d9", "analysis:content-length": 9003257, "analysis:last-modified-at": "2026-08-11T08:00:00+00:00", "analysis:last-modified-detection": "harvest-resource-metadata", "analysis:mime-type": "text/plain", "check:available": true, "check:cors:allow-headers": "Authorization, X-Requested-With, Origin, ODS-API-Analytics-App, ODS-API-Analytics-Embed-Type, ODS-API-Analytics-Embed-Referrer, ODS-Widgets-Version, Accept", "check:cors:allow-methods": "POST, GET, OPTIONS", "check:cors:allow-origin": "*", "check:cors:expose-headers": "ODS-Explore-API-Deprecation, Link, X-RateLimit-Remaining, X-RateLimit-Limit, X-RateLimit-Reset, X-RateLimit-dataset-Remaining, X-RateLimit-dataset-Limit, X-RateLimit-dataset-Reset", "check:cors:max-age": "1000", "check:cors:status": 200, "check:date": "2026-07-09T04:14:53.085534+00:00", "check:headers:content-type": "application/json", "check:id": 49706367, "check:status": 200, "check:timeout": false}, "filesize": null, "filetype": "remote", "format": "json", "harvest": {"issued_at": "2026-08-11T08:00:00+00:00", "last_update": "2026-10-03T00:02:30.489000+00:00", "modified_at": "2026-08-11T08:00:00+00:00", "uri": "https://data.economie.gouv.fr/api/explore/v2.1/catalog/datasets/dmto_recouv/exports/json"}, "id": "91a910b2-fb69-4a2f-a950-66c04825c289", "internal": {"created_at_internal": "2026-07-08T00:11:25.577000+00:00", "last_modified_internal": "2026-07-08T00:11:25.577000+00:00"}, "last_modified": "2026-08-11T08:00:00+00:00", "latest": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/api/1/datasets/r/91a910b2-fb69-4a2f-a950-66c04825c289", "metrics": {"views": 9}, "mime": "application/json", "preview_url": null, "schema": null, "title": "dmto_recouv.json", "type": "main", "url": "https://data.economie.gouv.fr/api/explore/v2.1/catalog/datasets/dmto_recouv/exports/json"}], "schema": null, "slug": "droits-de-mutations-a-titre-onereux-dimmeubles-par-direction-de-recouvrement", "spatial": null, "tags": ["dmto", "fiscalite"], "temporal_coverage": {"end": "2026-12-31", "start": "2018-12-31"}, "title": "Droits de mutations \u00e0 titre on\u00e9reux d'immeubles par direction de recouvrement", "uri": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/api/1/datasets/droits-de-mutations-a-titre-onereux-dimmeubles-par-direction-de-recouvrement/"}, {"access_audiences": [], "access_type": "open", "access_type_reason": null, "access_type_reason_category": null, "acronym": null, "archived": null, "authorization_request_url": null, "badges": [], "contact_points": [{"contact_form": null, "email": "dep-etudes-stat.diffusion@dgfip.finances.gouv.fr", "id": "67bfab593ec1b3fa4ae2608c", "name": null, "organization": {"acronym": "MEF", "badges": [{"kind": "public-service"}, {"kind": "certified"}], "class": "Organization", "id": "534fff8ea3a7292c64a77f02", "logo": "https://udata-avatars.s3.rbx.io.cloud.ovh.net/3b/06ce9c1027460a87364418789747b6.jpg", "logo_thumbnail": "https://udata-avatars.s3.rbx.io.cloud.ovh.net/3b/06ce9c1027460a87364418789747b6-100.jpg", "name": "Minist\u00e8res \u00e9conomiques et financiers", "page": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/organizations/ministeres-economiques-et-financiers", "permissions": {"delete": false, "edit": false, "harvest": false, "members": false, "private": false}, "slug": "ministeres-economiques-et-financiers", "uri": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/api/1/organizations/ministeres-economiques-et-financiers/"}, "owner": null, "role": "contact"}, {"contact_form": null, "email": null, "id": "6a4d95ac6eb89eb6c17a6797", "name": "DESF", "organization": {"acronym": "MEF", "badges": [{"kind": "public-service"}, {"kind": "certified"}], "class": "Organization", "id": "534fff8ea3a7292c64a77f02", "logo": "https://udata-avatars.s3.rbx.io.cloud.ovh.net/3b/06ce9c1027460a87364418789747b6.jpg", "logo_thumbnail": "https://udata-avatars.s3.rbx.io.cloud.ovh.net/3b/06ce9c1027460a87364418789747b6-100.jpg", "name": "Minist\u00e8res \u00e9conomiques et financiers", "page": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/organizations/ministeres-economiques-et-financiers", "permissions": {"delete": false, "edit": false, "harvest": false, "members": false, "private": false}, "slug": "ministeres-economiques-et-financiers", "uri": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/api/1/organizations/ministeres-economiques-et-financiers/"}, "owner": null, "role": "publisher"}], "created_at": "2026-08-11T08:00:00+00:00", "deleted": null, "description": "Les donn\u00e9es pr\u00e9sent\u00e9es correspondent aux recouvrements enregistr\u00e9s par direction locale dans la comptabilit\u00e9 auxiliaire de la DGFiP, retrait\u00e9s des recouvrements effectu\u00e9s pour le compte d'une autre direction locale. Cet enrichissement statistique permet d'approcher la part, identifi\u00e9e au stade du recouvrement, de chaque collectivit\u00e9 locale, avant op\u00e9rations de transfert et p\u00e9r\u00e9quations. Il peut conduire \u00e0 une ventilation par direction diff\u00e9rente de celle enregistr\u00e9e en comptabilit\u00e9 budg\u00e9taire auxiliaire. Ainsi, lorsqu'une op\u00e9ration est men\u00e9e par la direction de l'Ain mais concerne la direction de l'Is\u00e8re, la comptabilit\u00e9 auxiliaire l'enregistre au lieu effectif des op\u00e9rations (l'Ain) tandis que ce tableau la pr\u00e9sente pour la direction de l'Is\u00e8re.\n\nLes montants ventil\u00e9s par direction locale de recouvrement sont pr\u00e9sent\u00e9s dans [un autre jeu de donn\u00e9es](https://data.economie.gouv.fr/explore/assets/dmto_recouv/).\n\nLes recettes sont enregistr\u00e9es le mois de leur comptabilisation dans l'application MEDOC de comptabilit\u00e9 auxiliaire de la DGFiP, qui n'est pas forc\u00e9ment le mois o\u00f9 a lieu la transaction correspondante. En certains cas, des pics d\u2019enregistrement peuvent s'observer, correspondant \u00e0 des op\u00e9rations exceptionnelles ou \u00e0 l'enregistrement un mois donn\u00e9 de transactions des mois pr\u00e9c\u00e9dents, en lien avec la r\u00e9organisation du r\u00e9seau de la DGFiP  \n\n\nLa part d\u00e9partementale correspond \u00e0 la taxe d\u00e9partementale de publicit\u00e9 fonci\u00e8re, aux droits d\u00e9partementaux d'enregistrement et \u00e0 la taxe d\u00e9partementale additionnelle aux droits d'enregistrement, revers\u00e9s aux d\u00e9partements. \u00c0 compter de 2018, la collectivit\u00e9 de Corse poss\u00e8de un statut particulier au sens de l'article 72 de la Constitution, en lieu et place de la collectivit\u00e9 territoriale de Corse et des d\u00e9partements de Corse-du-Sud et de Haute-Corse (cf. art. L4421-1 du CGCT). La part d\u00e9partementale des deux anciens d\u00e9partements est ainsi agr\u00e9g\u00e9e sur l'ancien d\u00e9partement de Corse du Sud, si\u00e8ge de la pairie de la collectivit\u00e9.   \n  \nEn application de la loi du 2 ao\u00fbt 2019 (n\u00b02019-816), \u00e0 compter du 1er janvier 2021, les d\u00e9partements du Bas-Rhin et du Haut-Rhin sont regroup\u00e9s sous le nom de \u00ab Collectivit\u00e9 europ\u00e9enne d'Alsace \u00bb. La part d\u00e9partementale des deux anciens d\u00e9partements est ainsi agr\u00e9g\u00e9e sur l'ancien d\u00e9partement du Haut-Rhin, si\u00e8ge de la paierie de la Collectivit\u00e9 europ\u00e9enne d'Alsace.   \n  \nLa part d\u00e9partementale du d\u00e9partement du Rh\u00f4ne et de la M\u00e9tropole de Lyon sont agr\u00e9g\u00e9es sur le d\u00e9partement du Rh\u00f4ne.   \n  \nLa part communale correspond \u00e0 la taxe communale additionnelle aux droits d'enregistrement revers\u00e9e aux communes, somm\u00e9e sur l'ensemble des communes du d\u00e9partement.   \n  \nLa part r\u00e9gionale correspond \u00e0 taxe r\u00e9gionale additionnelle aux droits d'enregistrement.", "description_short": null, "extras": {}, "featured": false, "frequency": "monthly", "frequency_date": null, "harvest": {"backend": "DCAT", "dct_identifier": "https://data.economie.gouv.fr/explore/dataset/dmto_attrib/", "domain": "data.economie.gouv.fr", "issued_at": "2026-08-11T08:00:00+00:00", "last_update": "2026-10-03T00:02:34.872000+00:00", "modified_at": "2026-08-11T08:00:00+00:00", "remote_id": "https://data.economie.gouv.fr/explore/dataset/dmto_attrib/", "remote_url": "https://data.economie.gouv.fr/explore/dataset/dmto_attrib/", "source_id": "5cd454758b4c4139d85b64f2", "uri": "https://data.economie.gouv.fr/explore/dataset/dmto_attrib/"}, "id": "6a4d95acdda81151ddc275f2", "internal": {"created_at_internal": "2026-07-08T00:11:24.708000+00:00", "last_modified_internal": "2026-07-08T00:11:24.708000+00:00"}, "last_modified": "2026-08-11T08:00:00+00:00", "last_update": "2026-08-11T08:00:00+00:00", "license": "notspecified", 